# Basic tests (upstream has none for lzmainfo). The input files come from
# upstream's test suite.
#

: version-banner
:
$* --version >~'/lzmainfo \(XZ Utils\) [0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+/'

: known-size
:
$* <<<$src_base/good-known_size-with_eopm.lzma >>EOO
Uncompressed size:             0 MB (13 bytes)
Dictionary size:               0 MB (2^12 bytes)
Literal context bits (lc):     3
Literal pos bits (lp):         0
Number of pos bits (pb):       2
EOO

: unknown-size
:
$* <<<$src_base/good-unknown_size-with_eopm.lzma >>EOO
Uncompressed size:             Unknown
Dictionary size:               0 MB (2^12 bytes)
Literal context bits (lc):     3
Literal pos bits (lp):         0
Number of pos bits (pb):       2
EOO

: xz-input
:
: Test that the .xz format is rejected.
:
$* <<<$src_base/good-1-check-crc32.xz >- 2>>~/EOE/ != 0
/.+: \(stdin\): Not a \.lzma file/
